{"2151940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Too Many CUBES!", "steam_appid": 2151940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Too Many CUBES!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too Many CUBES! is a fast-paced arena-survival roguelike where every run begins with one small cube and ends in a storm of lasers, mines, orbiters, ricochets, gravity wells, and shattered geometry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move and aim while your weapons fire automatically. Collect experience, choose your upgrades, and assemble a build powerful enough to survive increasingly overwhelming swarms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151940/extras/4e1c39ab052e1c3c173610351dc41913.poster.avif?t=1787378779\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151940/extras/4e1c39ab052e1c3c173610351dc41913.webm?t=1787378779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151940/extras/4e1c39ab052e1c3c173610351dc41913.mp4?t=1787378779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR CUBE-STORM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry up to five weapons and five power-ups, each competing for a permanent place in your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level weapons through seven tiers, collect compatible power-ups, and defeat bosses to trigger animated chest lotteries. A chest always strengthens something you already own—and a max-level weapon with the correct power-up can evolve into a devastating super weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters. Chase raw damage, cover the arena with projectiles, improve your defenses, increase your pickup range, or create a carefully balanced combination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151940/extras/916f7cfedd494f3e2f4d8f8a042cbc93.poster.avif?t=1787378779\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151940/extras/916f7cfedd494f3e2f4d8f8a042cbc93.webm?t=1787378779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151940/extras/916f7cfedd494f3e2f4d8f8a042cbc93.mp4?t=1787378779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SAVE FIVE FRACTURED ZONES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across five zones with unique enemies, hazards, mechanics, and Guardians:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Shatterpoint</strong> — Friendly Fracture Pulses tear through the swarm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Neon Foundry</strong> — Live conduits transform the arena into a dangerous electrical grid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Cryo Vault</strong> — Freezing fronts sweep across the battlefield and slow everything they touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Void Garden</strong> — Strange blooms heal players while pulling nearby enemies inward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Solar Core</strong> — Expanding rings of fire erupt across an unstable stellar arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive until the zone’s Guardian arrives, break through its second phase, and destroy it before overtime sends it into a deadly rage. Victory triggers a screen-clearing Supernova and saves the zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151940/extras/63e62187dcd0d60556911ef71f50a0e6.poster.avif?t=1787378779\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151940/extras/63e62187dcd0d60556911ef71f50a0e6.webm?t=1787378779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151940/extras/63e62187dcd0d60556911ef71f50a0e6.mp4?t=1787378779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVOLVE. UNLOCK. RETURN STRONGER.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn coins during every attempt and spend them between runs on permanent starting bonuses, additional weapons, and new playable cube characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has a different starting weapon, health total, attributes, and special trait. Experiment with their strengths and discover which cube fits your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Successful Guardian clears unlock five increasingly dangerous Fracture tiers. Higher tiers strengthen enemies, increase swarm pressure, intensify special waves, and make each zone’s hazards more frequent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151940/extras/65b333e44b786cca897682f0c69dfffc.poster.avif?t=1787378779\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151940/extras/65b333e44b786cca897682f0c69dfffc.webm?t=1787378779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151940/extras/65b333e44b786cca897682f0c69dfffc.mp4?t=1787378779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY SOLO OR LOCAL CO-OP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone using keyboard and mouse or a controller, or connect a second controller for two-player local co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight as a team, revive a shattered partner, and stay within reach when the arena becomes crowded. A disconnected player can safely reclaim their place after reconnecting a controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151940/extras/bf4ce7f4a5a9de1b7e6a5530f5948961.poster.avif?t=1787378779\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151940/extras/bf4ce7f4a5a9de1b7e6a5530f5948961.webm?t=1787378779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151940/extras/bf4ce7f4a5a9de1b7e6a5530f5948961.mp4?t=1787378779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STUDY THE DESTRUCTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of every run, a detailed combat report shows weapon damage, damage share, eliminations, levels, and evolution status. Find out which weapon carried your build—and which one needs to stay in the shop next time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151940/extras/b067e57ff7853b09d6c8d6d9262ac8c2.poster.avif?t=1787378779\" width=720 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151940/extras/b067e57ff7853b09d6c8d6d9262ac8c2.webm?t=1787378779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151940/extras/b067e57ff7853b09d6c8d6d9262ac8c2.mp4?t=1787378779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fast-paced arena-survival combat with aimed automatic attacks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Five visually distinct zones with unique hazards and special enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Five multi-phase Guardian bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A large arsenal of weapons, power-ups, synergies, and evolutions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Animated boss chest lotteries with up to five rewards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Ten playable cubes with unique starting equipment and traits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Five unlockable Fracture difficulty tiers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Permanent upgrades and unlockable equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Twenty in-game achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Detailed post-run combat reports</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Solo play and two-player local co-op</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Keyboard, mouse, arrow-key, and controller support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Adjustable audio, effects, flashes, screen shake, hit stop, and controller dead zone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Remappable keyboard controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are too many cubes. Become the stronger cube.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151940/extras/ffbb4b8c4aecfad13d7b910e32d22075.avif?t=1787378779\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Too Many CUBES!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too Many CUBES! is a fast-paced arena-survival roguelike where every run begins with one small cube and ends in a storm of lasers, mines, orbiters, ricochets, gravity wells, and shattered geometry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move and aim while your weapons fire automatically. Collect experience, choose your upgrades, and assemble a build powerful enough to survive increasingly overwhelming swarms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151940/extras/4e1c39ab052e1c3c173610351dc41913.poster.avif?t=1787378779\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151940/extras/4e1c39ab052e1c3c173610351dc41913.webm?t=1787378779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151940/extras/4e1c39ab052e1c3c173610351dc41913.mp4?t=1787378779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR CUBE-STORM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry up to five weapons and five power-ups, each competing for a permanent place in your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level weapons through seven tiers, collect compatible power-ups, and defeat bosses to trigger animated chest lotteries. A chest always strengthens something you already own—and a max-level weapon with the correct power-up can evolve into a devastating super weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters. Chase raw damage, cover the arena with projectiles, improve your defenses, increase your pickup range, or create a carefully balanced combination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151940/extras/916f7cfedd494f3e2f4d8f8a042cbc93.poster.avif?t=1787378779\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151940/extras/916f7cfedd494f3e2f4d8f8a042cbc93.webm?t=1